<svg viewBox="0 0 720 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Monitoring and observability for AI applications">
  <g font-size="10.5">
    <rect x="40" y="20" width="310" height="160" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
    <text x="60" y="46" font-size="12.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Metrics — designed around failures</text>
    <text x="60" y="68" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· format failures (invalid JSON — and how fixable)</text>
    <text x="60" y="86" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· factual consistency, safety, refusal rates</text>
    <text x="60" y="104" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· conversational signals: stopped generations,</text>
    <text x="68" y="120" fill="var(--ink-soft)">turns per conversation, token lengths</text>
    <text x="60" y="138" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· latency (TTFT/TPOT) and cost per request</text>
    <text x="60" y="156" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· correlate with your business north star ·</text>
    <text x="68" y="172" fill="var(--ink-soft)">slice by user, version, prompt, time</text>

    <rect x="370" y="20" width="310" height="160" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
    <text x="390" y="46" font-size="12.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Logs &amp; traces</text>
    <text x="390" y="68" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· log EVERYTHING: configs, sampling settings,</text>
    <text x="398" y="84" fill="var(--ink-soft)">prompts, outputs, tool calls, intermediate steps</text>
    <text x="390" y="102" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· metrics say WHEN something broke;</text>
    <text x="398" y="118" fill="var(--ink-soft)">logs say WHAT happened</text>
    <text x="390" y="136" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· traces reconstruct each request's full path —</text>
    <text x="398" y="152" fill="var(--ink-soft)">pinpoint the failing step, its time, its cost</text>
    <text x="390" y="170" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· still inspect production data manually, daily</text>

    <rect x="40" y="196" width="310" height="120" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
    <text x="60" y="222" font-size="12.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Drift detection — what changes silently</text>
    <text x="60" y="244" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· system prompt changed (a coworker's typo fix)</text>
    <text x="60" y="262" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· user behavior adapts over time (shorter</text>
    <text x="68" y="278" fill="var(--ink-soft)">prompts, learned workarounds)</text>
    <text x="60" y="296" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· the API's underlying model updated unannounced</text>

    <rect x="370" y="196" width="310" height="120" rx="10" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" />
    <text x="390" y="222" font-size="12.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--accent-ink)">Health of the observability itself</text>
    <text x="390" y="244" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· MTTD — how fast do you detect problems?</text>
    <text x="390" y="262" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· MTTR — how fast do you resolve them?</text>
    <text x="390" y="280" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· CFR — % of deployments that fail; if unknown,</text>
    <text x="398" y="296" fill="var(--ink-soft)">your platform needs redesigning</text>
  </g>

  <text x="360" y="352" font-size="11.5" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Monitoring = tracking; observability = instrumenting so internal failures can be diagnosed from external outputs.</text>
  <text x="360" y="372" font-size="11.5" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Evaluation and monitoring are one loop: eval metrics should predict production metrics; production issues feed the eval set.</text>
</svg>
